__pycache__/
*.pyc

# PyInstaller's intermediate build directory - large, disposable, and
# regenerated fresh on every build (packaging/dist/ holds the actual output
# .exe, which IS tracked). One PyInstaller run left a 101MB DLL in here that
# GitHub hard-rejects outright (>100MB) if it's ever committed, so this
# whole directory stays out of git rather than relying on remembering to
# exclude the next oversized file it happens to produce. Regenerate with:
#   python -m PyInstaller packaging/VATComplianceAutomation.spec --distpath packaging/dist --workpath packaging/build --noconfirm
packaging/build/
